# 📘 TOEFL Academic Vocabulary - Day31

| Word | Meaning | Example |
|---|---|---|
| hypothesis | 가설 | The researchers tested their hypothesis. |
| demonstrate | 입증하다, 보여주다 | The experiment demonstrated the effect. |
| reliable | 신뢰할 수 있는 | Scientists need reliable data. |

---

## Synonyms

### hypothesis
→ proposed explanation

### demonstrate
→ show / prove

### reliable
→ trustworthy / dependable

---

## Useful Collocations

test a hypothesis
→ 가설을 검증하다

demonstrate an effect
→ 효과를 입증하다

reliable evidence
→ 신뢰할 수 있는 증거

reliable data
→ 신뢰할 수 있는 데이터

